																		This author commentary was written while wearing a fursuit.
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1267048); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1267048&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608498386" alt="Ihp" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1267048)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1267048); return false;" >Ihp</a></span> <span class="odate time_1481830378 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">15 Dec 2016 19:32</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2710131">
									

<p>For the two people who care: the UIU Series With No Name is coming back! &#8230;kind of! This takes place after the events of the main story, and is partly so I can get back to writing the characters of Darnell and Quinn, and partly to be fucking silly. I'll be writing new things in the main tale series some time in the next six months.</p>
<p>Special thanks to AidenEldritch, ProcyonLotor, and several other people who looked over this and supported this tale moving to completion. Hopefully you enjoy!</p>

